{title: Raja Raja Cholan Naan}
{artist: Ilaiyaraaja Yesudas}
{key: C#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[C#m] Raaja raaja chozhan [G#] naan,        [C#m] Enai aazhum kaadhal dhesam nee [F#m] thaan
[C#m] Raaja raaja chozhan [G#] naan,        [C#m] Enai aazhum kaadhal dhesam nee [F#m] thaan
[A] Poovae kaa [G#m] dhal thee [C#m] vae,        [C#m] Mann meedhu
[F#m] sorgam vandhu pennaaga [C#m] aanadhae,        [C#m] Ullaasa [F#m] bomomi inghu undaa [D] nathae
[C#m] Raaja raaja chozhan [G#] naan,        [C#m] Enai aazhum kaadhal dhesam nee [F#m] thaan
[A] Poovae kaa [G#m] dhal thee [C#m] vae,        [C#m] Kannodu kangal yettrum karpoora deepamae
[F#m] Kai theendum podhu paayum minsaa [G#] ramae
[C#m] Ullaasa medai melae orangha naadagam,        [F#m] Inbangal paadam sollum [A] enthaa [G#] yagam
[B] Ingangu oonjalaaga [E] naan pogiren,        [B] Angangu aasai theeyil naan [E] vegiren
[E] Un raaga moganam [G#] en kaadhal vaaganam,        [G#] Senthaamarai senthaen
[C#m] mazhai en aavi neeyae devi,        [C#m] Raaja raaja chozhan [G#] naan
[C#m] Enai aazhum kaadhal dhesam nee [F#m] thaan,        [A] Poovae kaa [G#m] dhal thee [C#m] vae
[C#m] Kalloora paarrkkum paarvai ulloora paayumae
[F#m] Thullaamal thullum ullam [A] sallaa [G#] bamae
[C#m] Villodu ambu rendu kollaamal kolludha
[F#m] Penpaavai kangal endru [A] poi [G#] solluthae
[B] Mundhaanai moodum raani [E] selvaakkilae,        [B] En kaadhal kangal pogum [E] pallaakkilae
[E] Thaenodai oramae [G#] neeraadum neramae,        [G#] Pullanguzhal thallaa [C#m] dumae
pon [F#m] meni [G#m] kelaai [C#m] raani,        [C#m] Raaja raaja chozhan [G#] naan
